window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>This ends here. It ends with us.</b></p> <p>After seeing the horrors Strand inflicted in the name of research, I thought they couldn’t surprise me anymore.</p> <p>I was wrong.</p> <p>When we learn the truth behind Doctor Shepherd’s experiments, it changes everything. Armed with that knowledge, we may finally have a way to end the Shifter Initiative once and for all.</p> <p>But even as we dig up Strand’s secrets and prepare for our final confrontation with them, I’m keeping a secret of my own. From my pack, and even worse...from my mates.</p> <p>When they find out what I’ve been hiding, will I lose everything I’ve been fighting for?</p> <p><i>Wolf Claimed is the thrilling conclusion to The Last Shifter series, a reverse harem story intended for ages 18+. This book contains strong language, violence, sexual situations, and a fierce heroine who doesn't have to choose between her men.</i></p>"; 
